Phase1: "1. Parse & Deduplicate Dump Inquiries\nExtract raw questions, verify codebase coverage\nBucket A (Covered), B (Edge Case), C (Uncovered)" { class: p1 }
Phase2: "2. Base Topic Coverage Verification\nAudit theoretical foundations, memory models\nExpand 0X_topic.md with deep mechanics" { class: p2 }
Phase3: "3. FAQ Integration (D2 + SVG Diagrams)\nAuthor standalone .d2 and compiled .svg vector pairs\nEmbed via markdown link with strict blank line" { class: p3 }
Phase4: "4. Establish Bidirectional Linking\nBase Topic [!TIP] callout -> Companion FAQ scenario\nFAQ question footer -> Base topic theoretical anchor" { class: p4 }
Phase5: "5. Audit Master Indexes & TOCs\nUpdate Study Guide tables & question totals\nUpdate 00_*_faq_index.md domain scope & counts" { class: p5 }
Phase6: "6. Scripted Link & Anchor Validation\nAutomated Python script audits 100% of links\nGuarantees 0 broken links & 100% dump coverage" { class: p6 }
Phase7: "7. Clear Synced Question Dump\nTruncate questions-dump.md to clean placeholder\nPrevents duplicate reprocessing in future runs" { class: p7 }

Phase1 -> Phase2: "Gap Analysis"
Phase2 -> Phase3: "Core Theory Ready"
Phase3 -> Phase4: "Scenarios Integrated"
Phase4 -> Phase5: "Bidirectional Links"
Phase5 -> Phase6: "Indexes Synchronized"
Phase6 -> Phase7: "100% Verification PASS"
